 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Aisaretenda to Jikakushina"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "愛されてんだと自覚しな"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A thousand years ago, a woman and the man she loved were cursed to reincarnate, having turned down a proposal of marriage from a god. The two, repeating their lives, met and parted at various times, and then in the present day. Okada Anzu, who has a magnificent past, has completely abandoned her “search for a fated lover” and is now enjoying her life with her roommate, a named Shoko. In the midst of a world where people and gods run around, and where love and desire beyond time are intertwined, the story of the strongest duo, who go their own way with ease!",
   "ja": "千年前、女は神からの求婚を袖にして、愛する男と共に輪廻転生の呪いをかけられた。 生を繰り返すふたりは様々な時代で出会っては別れ、そして現代。壮大な過去を背負う岡田杏は、しかしすっかり「運命の恋人探し」を放棄して、ルームメイトの盗み屋・祥子と共に令和の世を謳歌していた!? 人と神とが駆け回り、時を超えた愛と欲とが入り乱れる只中で、悠々と我が道を行く最強コンビの物語がコミカライズで登場――！"
  },
